-- words --
Two acts that cannot both stand: from a base whose store holds Goal G-ONE, the owner closes G-ONE on branch main and lands or closes it again on branch side. After git merge, hyp status shows the later act refused at replay, as on H0.
-- run --
git merge --no-edit side >/dev/null 2>&1; echo "merge exit: $?"; hyp status G-ONE
-- floor: contains --
merge exit: 0
-- floor: contains --
refused at replay
